.Dd October 16, 2026
.Dt LCC-LOCALE 1
.Os @PROJECT_VERSION@

.Sh NAME
.Nm lcc-locale
.Nd configure the locale used by the Lumina session.

.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl h | -help
.Op Fl v | -version

.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is part of the Lumina Control Center.
It sets the locale applied when the Lumina session starts.
Each category can be set independently from the list of locales known to
the system:
.Bl -tag -width "Monetary" -offset indent
.It Language
.Ev LANG
.It Messages
.Ev LC_MESSAGES
.It Time
.Ev LC_TIME
.It Numeric
.Ev LC_NUMERIC
.It Monetary
.Ev LC_MONETARY
.It Collate
.Ev LC_COLLATE
.It CType
.Ev LC_CTYPE
.El
.Pp
Changes take effect after the session is restarted.

.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Display help on command line options.
.It Fl v , Fl -version
Display version information.
.El

.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Pa /usr/local/bin/lcc-locale
.It Pa $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/lumina-desktop/sessionsettings.conf
Locale values are stored in the
.Qq InitLocale
group.
.El

.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr lcc 1 ,
.Xr lcc-session 1 ,
.Xr locale 1

